    "code": " n = int(input())\n\nk = int(input())\n\nA = int(input())\n\nB = int(input())\n\nmans = 0\n\nif k == 1:\n\n    print((n - 1) * A)\n\nelse:\n\n    while n != 1:\n\n        if n % k == 0:\n\n            next_n = n // k\n\n            cost = (n - next_n) * A\n\n            mans += min(cost, B)\n\n            n = next_n\n\n        else:\n\n            x = n - n % k\n\n            if x == 0:\n\n                mans += (n - 1) * A\n\n                n = 1\n\n            else:\n\n                mans += (n - x) * A\n\n                n = x\n\n    print(mans)",
